\" height=\"22\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-menu\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M4 5h16\"></path><path d=\"M4 12h16\"></path><path d=\"M4 19h16\"></path></svg></button></div></header><main class=\"flex-1\"><div class=\"max-w-[1280px] mx-auto px-4 sm:px-6 py-10\"><div class=\"flex flex-col sm:flex-row items-center sm:items-start gap-6 mb-10\"><div class=\"relative w-24 h-24 rounded-full overflow-hidden flex-shrink-0 bg-[var(--color-muted)]\"><img alt=\"Anna Kowalski\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" data-nimg=\"fill\" class=\"object-cover\" style=\"position:absolute;height:100%;width:100%;left:0;top:0;right:0;bottom:0;color:transparent\" src=\"https://s.alicdn.com/@sc02/kf/A301064cf376746bb8e4e8f6d90cae9df5.jpg\"/></div><div><h1 class=\"text-3xl font-bold mb-2\">Anna Kowalski</h1><p class=\"text-[var(--color-muted-fg)] max-w-xl\">Master Gardener Emeritus and horticulture educator with 25 years of teaching and writing experience. Holds an M.Ed. in Agricultural Education from Michigan State University and has trained over 3,000 Master Gardener volunteers across the Midwest. Author of four gardening books including The Four-Season Harvest Handbook (Storey Publishing) and Companion Planting Decoded, an Amazon bestseller in the Organic Gardening category. Former extension agent for the USDA Cooperative Extension Service and regular contributor to Fine Gardening, Organic Gardening Magazine, and the National Gardening Association educational programs.</p></div></div><h2 class=\"text-xl font-bold mb-6\">Articles by <!-- -->Anna Kowalski</h2><div class=\"grid grid-cols-1 sm:grid-cols-2 lg:grid-cols-3 gap-6\"><article class=\"group flex flex-col bg-white border border-[var(--color-border)] rounded-xl overflow-hidden hover:shadow-md transition-shadow\"><a class=\"block relative aspect-[16/9] overflow-hidden bg-[var(--color-muted)]\" href=\"/blog/diy-leaf-miner-control-vegetable-flower-gardens\"><img alt=\"DIY Leaf Miner Control for Vegetable &amp; Flower Gardens: A Complete Guide\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" data-nimg=\"fill\" class=\"object-cover group-hover:scale-105 transition-transform duration-300\" style=\"position:absolute;height:100%;width:100%;left:0;top:0;right:0;bottom:0;color:transparent\" src=\"https://s.alicdn.com/@sc02/kf/Ad7068fbbabfb48a6a7e2cb179074d295C.jpg\"/></a><div class=\"p-4 flex flex-col flex-1\"><a class=\"text-xs font-semibold text-[var(--color-primary)] uppercase tracking-wide mb-2 hover:underline\" href=\"/categories/pest-control\">Pest Control</a><a href=\"/blog/diy-leaf-miner-control-vegetable-flower-gardens\"><h2 class=\"font-bold text-base leading-snug mb-2 group-hover:text-[var(--color-primary)] transition-colors line-clamp-2\">DIY Leaf Miner Control for Vegetable &amp; Flower Gardens: A Complete Guide</h2></a><p class=\"text-sm text-[var(--color-muted-fg)] line-clamp-2 flex-1\">Learn how to identify, prevent, and eliminate leaf miners in your vegetable and flower gardens with proven DIY methods and organic solutions.</p><div class=\"mt-3 flex items-center justify-between text-xs text-[var(--color-muted-fg)]\"><span>Anna Kowalski</span><time dateTime=\"2026-08-30 00:27:34\">Aug 30, 2026</time></div></div></article><article class=\"group flex flex-col bg-white border border-[var(--color-border)] rounded-xl overflow-hidden hover:shadow-md transition-shadow\"><a class=\"block relative aspect-[16/9] overflow-hidden bg-[var(--color-muted)]\" href=\"/blog/sunday-lawn-care-organic\"><img alt=\"Sunday Lawn Care Organic: The Complete Guide to Natural, Chemical-Free Lawn Treatment\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" data-nimg=\"fill\" class=\"object-cover group-hover:scale-105 transition-transform duration-300\" style=\"position:absolute;height:100%;width:100%;left:0;top:0;right:0;bottom:0;color:transparent\" src=\"https://s.alicdn.com/@sc02/kf/A58780092c8ff42379ae52f893ade9c